spans.s:
. Sūcīpattra 14. Tu7b. 5. Vaṅgīya p. 214. Varendra 1021.
An a.'s own C. ‘Kiraṇa’ mentioned (Kane, Intro. to Sāhityadarpaṇa p. clxi a an. D., Skt. Poe. I. p. 260) seems to be a mistake. ‘Kiraṇa’ is the name of the sections of the A. Kaustubha; the C. meant is evidently the author's own Vṛtti;
Pt.. Varendra Res.
